#: cmd/server/bootstrap.go:23
msgid "欢迎来到我的博客"
msgstr "Welcome to my blog"

#: cmd/server/bootstrap.go:24
msgid "关于"
msgstr "About"

#: cmd/server/bootstrap.go:25
msgid "欢迎使用这个博客程序，你可以在后台管理评论，快去看看吧。"
msgstr ""
"Welcome to this blog app. You can manage comments in the admin panel—go take "
"a look."

#: cmd/server/bootstrap.go:26
msgid ""
"欢迎使用这个独立博客程序。它专注于：\n"
"\n"
"- **简单部署**：单二进制 + SQLite，适合个人博客快速上线。\n"
"- **内容优先**：支持 Markdown 写作，也兼容逐步整理已有内容。\n"
"- **可持续维护**：后台可管理文章、页面、评论、资源与模板。\n"
"\n"
"你可以先到后台看看设置、写一篇文章、再把这里改成真正属于你自己的首页开场白。"
"祝写作愉快。"
msgstr ""
"Welcome to this independent blog app. It focuses on:\n"
"\n"
"- **Simple deployment**: a single binary plus SQLite, great for getting a "
"personal blog online quickly.\n"
"- **Content first**: write in Markdown while keeping it easy to gradually "
"organize existing content.\n"
"- **Sustainable maintenance**: manage posts, pages, comments, assets, and "
"templates from the admin panel.\n"
"\n"
"You can start by exploring the admin settings, writing a post, and then "
"replacing this with an introduction that truly feels like your own homepage. "
"Happy writing."

#: cmd/server/bootstrap.go:27
msgid ""
"你好，欢迎来到这里。\n"
"\n"
"我是这个博客的作者，喜欢记录技术、写作、日常想法，也会把一些正在尝试和思考的"
"东西慢慢整理出来。这里不会只放“结论”，也会保留过程、踩坑和一些还没完全想清楚"
"的问题。\n"
"\n"
"如果你恰好读到某篇文章，希望它能给你一点启发；如果你也在做相似的事情，欢迎交"
"流。"
msgstr ""
"Hi, welcome.\n"
"\n"
"I'm the author of this blog. I like writing about technology, everyday "
"thoughts, and things I'm currently exploring or thinking through. This space "
"won't only keep the final conclusions—it will also keep the process, the "
"pitfalls, and some questions I haven't fully figured out yet.\n"
"\n"
"If you happen to read a post here, I hope it offers you a bit of "
"inspiration. And if you're working on similar things, feel free to reach out."

